<section itemprop="abstract" itemscope="">
<h2>Abstract</h2>
<div html="" itemprop="content"><abstract lang="EN" load-source="docdb" mxw-id="PA635769225" source="national office">
<div class="abstract">Substituted quinolone carboxylic acids and their derivatives are described. These compounds modulate the effect of gamma-aminobutyric acid (GABA) via a novel site on the GABA&lt;SUB&gt;A &lt;/SUB&gt;receptor complex in a therapeutically relevant fashion and may be used to ameliorate CNS disorders amenable to modulation of the GABA&lt;SUB&gt;A &lt;/SUB&gt;receptor complex.</div>
</abstract>
</div>
</section>
